WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 40=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:44.319 --> 01:44.799
A cricket?

01:44.799 --> 01:45.640
That's it?

01:45.879 --> 01:48.519
The Lin family's Third Young Madam

01:48.599 --> 01:50.560
gave the Fourth Young Lady a cricket.

01:50.719 --> 01:51.840
Once word gets out,

01:52.040 --> 01:54.439
it'll be quite the tale in Jinling City.

01:54.439 --> 01:55.079
Exactly.

01:55.080 --> 01:56.184
That's hardly a proper gift.

01:58.760 --> 02:00.120
I told you to prepare a dowry gift,

02:00.319 --> 02:02.079
and you got me a cricket?

02:03.079 --> 02:03.840
What's going on?

02:04.840 --> 02:06.640
This is no ordinary cricket.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.879
It's a Matou King.

02:07.920 --> 02:08.800
If we sold it,

02:08.800 --> 02:10.800
it'd fetch at least sixty gold.

02:12.479 --> 02:13.159
What rubbish!

02:13.159 --> 02:14.240
All right.

02:14.360 --> 02:14.919
That's enough.

02:15.960 --> 02:18.199
Today is Xiushu's happy day.

02:18.439 --> 02:19.520
Both of you, say no more.

02:19.520 --> 02:20.639
Say no more.

02:20.639 --> 02:21.400
Go on, sell it!

02:21.479 --> 02:22.240
Go on, sell it!

02:22.360 --> 02:24.439
How did I end up marrying
such a useless man?

02:24.639 --> 02:26.120
Get me back my sixty gold!

02:26.130 --> 02:27.560
- You lost your post!
- It's all right.

02:27.560 --> 02:28.460
And we have no money!

02:28.470 --> 02:29.879
Besides humiliating me,

02:30.080 --> 02:31.599
what else can you do?

02:32.280 --> 02:33.280
Son!

02:34.008 --> 02:36.630
- There are many people here.
- It's all your useless father's fault.

02:36.639 --> 02:37.159
Let go of me!

02:37.159 --> 02:40.159
The Lin family claims Young Master Lin

02:40.240 --> 02:41.879
resigned to come home and be filial.

02:42.080 --> 02:43.479
Who'd be that foolish?

02:43.560 --> 02:45.280
Giving up a high post in the capital

02:45.280 --> 02:46.439
to sit idle at home?

02:46.840 --> 02:48.319
He must have lost His Majesty's favor

02:48.319 --> 02:49.919
and come slinking back.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.360
And this Third Young Master Lin

02:51.680 --> 02:53.120
never had any real ability.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.639
Once his backer fell,

02:54.639 --> 02:56.039
his colleagues pushed him out,

02:56.159 --> 02:57.240
and he lost his post.

02:58.120 --> 02:59.960
Doesn't the Lin family still have

02:59.960 --> 03:01.304
Marquis Yongchang as a son-in-law?

03:02.159 --> 03:03.520
Just look.

03:03.759 --> 03:05.400
With that whole string of daughters,

03:05.800 --> 03:08.080
the Third Young Lady is overwhelmed,

03:08.439 --> 03:10.120
let alone helping her own family.

03:10.319 --> 03:11.240
No wonder.

03:12.439 --> 03:13.199
I heard

03:14.312 --> 03:15.630
she was once in marriage talks

03:15.639 --> 03:18.120
with Duke Xiangguo's grandson.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.039
She was to marry into a duke's family,

03:20.719 --> 03:22.280
and then suddenly it all fell through.

03:22.360 --> 03:23.520
So

03:23.719 --> 03:25.800
Third Young Madam Lin crying now

03:25.960 --> 03:27.319
is rather fitting.

03:28.439 --> 03:29.800
What did you say?

03:30.680 --> 03:31.800
What about me?

03:32.000 --> 03:32.919
What about you?

03:33.240 --> 03:34.719
Come on, say that again!

03:34.800 --> 03:35.840
You want a fight?

03:35.840 --> 03:37.360
So what if I hit you?

03:37.520 --> 03:38.719
Mother, let go of me!

03:39.199 --> 03:40.000
Say it again!

03:40.010 --> 03:40.890
Come on, say it again!

03:40.900 --> 03:41.719
Say it!

03:41.759 --> 03:42.319
I did say it.

03:42.319 --> 03:43.280
What are you going to do?

03:43.479 --> 03:44.319
Say no more.

03:44.719 --> 03:45.240
Say no more.

03:45.319 --> 03:46.319
You want a fight?

03:46.319 --> 03:47.800
So what if I hit you?

03:47.879 --> 03:49.080
Mother, let go of me!

03:49.639 --> 03:50.520
Say it again!

03:50.520 --> 03:52.199
Come on, say it again! Say it!

03:52.879 --> 03:53.719
Keep going!

03:53.719 --> 03:54.680
You unfilial girl!

03:54.680 --> 03:56.159
Once a creature of the wild grass,

03:56.760 --> 03:58.328
I've now risen to the great hall.

03:59.240 --> 04:02.199
I'll never forget my wise lord's favor.

04:02.879 --> 04:05.840
Well fed in my jar, I stay sharp.

04:06.280 --> 04:09.680
Fierce in the ring, I crush the strong.

04:10.479 --> 04:12.599
His Majesty is fond of crickets.

04:13.080 --> 04:16.079
A palace eunuch, at His Majesty's order,

04:16.319 --> 04:19.079
wrote this poem especially for crickets,

04:19.120 --> 04:22.839
using them to voice lofty ambitions.

04:24.240 --> 04:26.079
No wonder the poem sounds so good.

04:26.399 --> 04:28.519
So it came from the palace.

04:29.839 --> 04:32.079
A fine poem.

04:32.160 --> 04:33.759
A fine poem indeed.

04:33.759 --> 04:36.600
Now Jinqiao has given me a cricket,

04:36.759 --> 04:39.319
surely to encourage Third Master Yang

04:39.519 --> 04:42.439
to honor royal favor like this cricket

04:42.440 --> 04:43.870
and always strive to better himself.

04:44.160 --> 04:45.040
With this gift,

04:45.600 --> 04:47.319
let's all strive for this together.

04:47.639 --> 04:48.439
Yes.

04:48.439 --> 04:50.519
- Together.
- Together.

04:50.519 --> 04:52.319
Together.

04:59.879 --> 05:02.079
The Cheng family is steeped in learning,

05:02.439 --> 05:04.079
and you're quite literary, Fengxian.

05:04.120 --> 05:05.720
You must have heard this poem, right?

05:07.879 --> 05:09.879
Yes, I have.

05:10.279 --> 05:11.279
It's a fine poem.

05:13.680 --> 05:14.839
One more thing.

05:15.319 --> 05:16.839
His Majesty has sent palace eunuchs

05:17.000 --> 05:18.920
to collect crickets among the people.

05:19.160 --> 05:20.720
Any cricket chosen for tribute

05:20.959 --> 05:23.279
wins a hundred gold and official rank.

05:23.959 --> 05:24.639
Well...

05:24.640 --> 05:25.928
So it really is worth sixty gold.

05:26.120 --> 05:28.240
One cricket can win an official post?

05:28.720 --> 05:29.920
It's absolutely true.

05:31.720 --> 05:33.720
Sister Niu, if you don't believe me,

05:33.720 --> 05:35.240
go ask your husband.

05:36.160 --> 05:38.000
To curry favor with the Second Prince's

05:38.000 --> 05:39.279
- palace eunuchs,
- I...

05:40.079 --> 05:41.600
he asked me just last month

05:41.800 --> 05:43.879
where to find a good cricket like this.

05:47.720 --> 05:48.639
That never happened.

05:59.319 --> 06:01.199
Why did she have to be a servant?

06:23.199 --> 06:25.240
No wonder Fengtai insisted on Lanxiang.

06:26.959 --> 06:28.240
In this world, a few words

06:28.240 --> 06:29.439
that can settle a dispute

06:29.639 --> 06:30.600
are rare indeed.

06:31.319 --> 06:32.439
But rarer still

06:33.000 --> 06:34.399
is claiming no credit for it.

06:39.160 --> 06:40.319
Because of me today,

06:40.879 --> 06:43.319
Xiuru and my wife were both wronged.

06:47.759 --> 06:50.120
No wonder those ignorant women gossip.

06:51.439 --> 06:52.920
But I don't understand it either.

06:54.160 --> 06:55.040
Why would you give up

06:55.040 --> 06:57.319
real power as Left Chief Commander
of the Rear Military Command

06:58.040 --> 07:00.120
and insist on resigning to Jinling?

07:01.839 --> 07:04.480
Then His Majesty cut military spending,

07:05.079 --> 07:06.920
so there's still no real post for you,

07:07.959 --> 07:09.680
and you're left idle at home.

07:17.319 --> 07:18.319
I'm the eldest grandson.

07:19.720 --> 07:21.079
Since childhood, Grandfather

07:21.300 --> 07:23.000
and the family have
had high hopes for me.

07:24.240 --> 07:25.879
I was always pushed forward,

07:26.839 --> 07:29.639
thinking only of getting ahead.

07:30.360 --> 07:32.279
It's rare to have some peaceful days

07:32.439 --> 07:34.160
to be still and ask

07:34.839 --> 07:35.439
myself

07:39.000 --> 07:40.360
which path I truly want to take,

07:42.439 --> 07:43.480
and which way to follow.

07:46.959 --> 07:48.399
Getting ahead,

07:48.872 --> 07:50.360
bringing glory to one's ancestors...

07:51.959 --> 07:53.079
What's wrong with that?

07:54.480 --> 07:56.439
Shouldn't a man seek rank and riches

07:56.792 --> 07:58.310
and win honors for his wife and sons?

08:01.040 --> 08:01.839
Jinqi.

08:06.439 --> 08:07.240
Jinqiao.

08:08.280 --> 08:09.790
I've found a great way to make money.

08:09.816 --> 08:11.350
I want to discuss it with you, Jinqi.

08:11.360 --> 08:13.360
Shaohui, help me think it through, too.

08:17.079 --> 08:17.920
What is it?

08:19.120 --> 08:20.319
All I need is a ship

08:20.480 --> 08:21.839
and a merchant license.

08:21.920 --> 08:23.759
I ship silk and porcelain from Jiangnan

08:23.879 --> 08:24.879
to Quanzhou,

08:24.880 --> 08:26.232
and make several times the profit.

08:26.639 --> 08:28.680
So if I put in a thousand taels,

08:28.839 --> 08:30.120
I'll make several thousand.

08:32.720 --> 08:33.759
Do you know

08:34.679 --> 08:37.279
who buys the silk and porcelain?

08:38.759 --> 08:39.919
Who cares who buys it?

08:39.919 --> 08:40.960
In business,

08:41.000 --> 08:42.480
all that matters is selling the goods.

08:43.080 --> 08:44.519
The court enforces a maritime ban.

08:44.919 --> 08:46.279
Apart from tribute missions,

08:46.639 --> 08:48.480
trade with foreigners is forbidden.

08:48.759 --> 08:50.879
The buyers who'd make you that profit

08:51.279 --> 08:52.879
are those very foreigners.

08:54.159 --> 08:54.960
Right.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.840
Fujian has few fields and rough terrain.

08:58.279 --> 09:00.440
People rely on Zhejiang and Guangdong,

09:00.759 --> 09:02.240
shipping rice in by sea,

09:02.440 --> 09:04.320
just to scrape by.

09:04.720 --> 09:06.720
Yet some take the risk

09:06.879 --> 09:08.559
of shipping silk and porcelain

09:08.559 --> 09:10.519
from Jiangnan to Quanzhou

09:11.720 --> 09:13.200
and selling it to foreigners in secret

09:13.519 --> 09:14.919
for many times the profit.

09:15.279 --> 09:16.399
But if caught,

09:17.080 --> 09:22.320
by law, a hundred strokes or beheading.

09:25.320 --> 09:26.159
This fortune...

09:27.759 --> 09:28.919
do you still want to make it?

09:30.559 --> 09:31.200
No.

09:31.399 --> 09:32.039
Not anymore.

09:33.159 --> 09:35.039
Jinqi, forget I said anything.

09:35.600 --> 09:36.399
I'm off.

09:40.799 --> 09:41.600
Jinqiao.

09:47.960 --> 09:49.039
Because I resigned,

09:50.240 --> 09:51.879
you lost your post.

09:53.720 --> 09:54.639
Do you blame me?

10:01.080 --> 10:02.240
I only got that post

10:02.240 --> 10:04.039
thanks to you in the first place.

10:04.039 --> 10:05.159
I wasn't capable enough

10:05.159 --> 10:05.960
to keep it.

10:06.080 --> 10:07.440
How is that your fault?

10:07.879 --> 10:10.039
Jinqi, you've never called me useless,

10:10.159 --> 10:12.080
so how could I blame you?

10:13.919 --> 10:14.360
Jinqi,

10:15.559 --> 10:16.919
don't overthink it.

10:19.120 --> 10:20.080
I'm meeting a friend.

10:30.720 --> 10:31.879
Jinqiao has a pure heart.

10:32.879 --> 10:33.879
Having a brother like him

10:34.279 --> 10:35.399
is a blessing for you and me.

10:40.440 --> 10:41.440
In the past,

10:41.528 --> 10:42.550
I could have found Jinqiao

10:42.559 --> 10:44.120
a post in the army.

10:45.120 --> 10:47.480
But now, troops are cut everywhere.

10:48.440 --> 10:50.519
Don't worry about Jinqiao's post.

10:51.440 --> 10:52.919
He won't starve anytime soon.

10:56.039 --> 10:57.720
As long as not having a son

10:58.879 --> 11:00.120
doesn't make you resent Xiuru,

11:03.039 --> 11:04.200
Jinqiao and I

11:06.440 --> 11:07.840
will be content.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.480
Fengtai.

11:14.320 --> 11:15.440
I told you before,

11:15.550 --> 11:17.096
it was because I valued your character

11:17.159 --> 11:19.279
that I sought to join our two families.

11:20.240 --> 11:22.039
How could I ever break my word?

11:26.919 --> 11:28.279
Besides, Xiuru is still young.

11:28.936 --> 11:30.390
She'll have a son sooner or later.

11:35.240 --> 11:37.240
"You're still young,

11:37.399 --> 11:39.080
and a son will come sooner or later?"

11:39.559 --> 11:41.679
Stop trying to fool me!

11:45.000 --> 11:46.440
You're thirty-nine,

11:47.080 --> 11:49.480
nearly forty.

11:50.320 --> 11:52.480
She's twenty-six

11:52.919 --> 11:55.720
and had three useless girls in a row.

11:57.240 --> 12:00.240
Must I go to my grave

12:00.240 --> 12:03.440
still longing for a grandson?

12:05.679 --> 12:07.200
Mother, don't make yourself ill.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.480
Mother, please calm down.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.720
Have some water for your throat.

12:16.159 --> 12:17.519
It's all my fault.

12:17.720 --> 12:19.919
If you know you're at fault,

12:21.159 --> 12:22.200
have you considered

12:23.200 --> 12:24.279
what you should do

12:24.799 --> 12:28.039
as a wife of the Marquis's house?

12:28.879 --> 12:29.840
I don't know.

12:30.679 --> 12:32.000
Please guide me, Mother.

12:32.559 --> 12:34.720
Since you can't give him a son,

12:35.360 --> 12:36.279
you should

12:36.559 --> 12:38.399
find your husband a concubine soon

12:38.519 --> 12:39.879
so he'll have a son soon.

12:40.240 --> 12:43.200
That's what a virtuous wife does!

12:50.120 --> 12:51.679
Mother, I...

12:51.919 --> 12:52.519
Mother,

12:54.039 --> 12:55.480
give Xiuru one more chance.

12:55.864 --> 12:56.440
We'll surely...

12:56.440 --> 12:58.360
Must you drive me to my death

12:58.360 --> 13:00.039
before you'll agree?

13:00.039 --> 13:00.919
No, I...

13:01.840 --> 13:03.159
By court law,

13:04.919 --> 13:07.679
officials can't wed freeborn concubines.

13:08.279 --> 13:09.759
But women bought from outside

13:10.159 --> 13:11.480
have unknown backgrounds.

13:11.679 --> 13:12.840
I don't trust them.

13:13.559 --> 13:15.159
She must come from a clean background

13:15.639 --> 13:17.240
and have a gentle nature.

13:17.879 --> 13:19.399
After much thought,

13:20.759 --> 13:23.000
only Biwu is truly reliable.

13:25.220 --> 13:26.919
(Biwu, Old Madam Yuan's head maid,
daughter of Yuan family's head butler)

13:26.919 --> 13:27.720
Mother!

13:29.720 --> 13:30.480
Biwu's father

13:31.279 --> 13:33.120
is our household's head butler.

13:33.559 --> 13:36.200
A fortune-teller cast Biwu's chart.

13:36.519 --> 13:39.480
She's fated to bear sons and bring luck.

13:40.639 --> 13:41.440
Mother!

13:43.919 --> 13:44.720
Blood?

13:45.519 --> 13:46.200
Mother!

13:47.440 --> 13:48.440
Rest for a while.

13:53.519 --> 13:54.360
You...

13:55.120 --> 13:56.360
Will you agree?

13:56.360 --> 13:57.039
I...

13:59.480 --> 14:02.799
Three days from now is a lucky day.

14:03.720 --> 14:06.840
We'll hold the concubine ceremony then!

14:08.519 --> 14:09.799
If I'm lucky,

14:10.080 --> 14:12.840
I may see a grandson before I die,

14:14.360 --> 14:15.679
and then peacefully

14:15.679 --> 14:18.480
go join your father below.

14:28.720 --> 14:29.639
I agree.

14:55.559 --> 14:57.720
Your Lordship, here's the medicine.

14:59.039 --> 14:59.840
I'll do it.

15:00.879 --> 15:02.559
Biwu, come.

16:17.120 --> 16:17.919
Mother.

16:20.600 --> 16:21.600
Silly child.

16:21.759 --> 16:23.120
I'm already soaked.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.720
Don't get yourself wet too.

16:42.200 --> 16:43.799
Even if not for yourself,

16:44.679 --> 16:46.279
then for me and my three sisters,

16:46.480 --> 16:48.879
you mustn't put your body through this.

16:51.039 --> 16:52.279
You're right, Jiarong.

16:53.240 --> 16:54.440
I was wrong.

16:56.720 --> 16:58.720
Ever since you married into this family,

16:59.320 --> 17:00.480
you've given your all

17:00.888 --> 17:02.000
serving your mother-in-law

17:02.519 --> 17:04.079
and treated me like your own daughter.

17:04.519 --> 17:06.559
You've never done a single thing wrong.

17:08.079 --> 17:10.119
What Third Granduncle and his kin plot,

17:11.279 --> 17:13.680
Grandmother may be too blind to see,

17:13.960 --> 17:15.559
but I see it all clearly.

17:16.279 --> 17:17.480
If Biwu's son

17:18.079 --> 17:19.400
inherits the title,

17:21.160 --> 17:22.759
this Yuan household

17:23.559 --> 17:25.519
will fall to Third Granduncle's family.

17:26.079 --> 17:28.599
What place would be left for us sisters?

17:36.839 --> 17:38.079
It's my fault.

17:39.000 --> 17:39.759
It's all because I

17:40.160 --> 17:41.319
couldn't bear a son.

17:42.720 --> 17:43.920
Not only has the Marquis

17:43.920 --> 17:45.599
been branded unfilial,

17:46.559 --> 17:49.039
but you girls have no one to rely on.

17:49.119 --> 17:50.640
How can that be your fault?

17:51.599 --> 17:53.000
It's Heaven's fault.

17:54.279 --> 17:56.680
Why can't a daughter inherit the title?

18:05.000 --> 18:06.119
You always say

18:06.319 --> 18:07.799
Grandmother is shrewd and capable,

18:08.519 --> 18:10.279
and Aunt Lanxiang is wise and gracious.

18:10.728 --> 18:12.240
Why don't we go to the Lin Residence

18:12.400 --> 18:15.079
and ask them to think of something?

18:21.820 --> 18:25.020
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

18:26.680 --> 18:28.359
When Jiaming was born,

18:28.960 --> 18:30.119
I reminded you

18:30.440 --> 18:32.279
to find the Marquis a concubine.

18:33.319 --> 18:35.480
But you held too dear
the love you shared

18:35.480 --> 18:36.720
and would not give him up.

18:37.480 --> 18:39.720
You claimed the Marquis said

18:40.039 --> 18:41.079
court officials

18:41.160 --> 18:43.279
must be sonless at forty to take one.

18:43.839 --> 18:45.119
Didn't you stop to think

18:45.240 --> 18:47.839
how few officials really keep that rule?

18:49.559 --> 18:50.720
And now look.

18:51.440 --> 18:53.599
The Yuan clan has you by the throat.

18:54.079 --> 18:55.559
Your mother-in-law resents you,

18:55.880 --> 18:57.720
and you're called a jealous wife.

18:57.960 --> 18:59.799
We can't blame the Third Young Lady.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.599
We were all young once.

19:02.960 --> 19:04.599
Who hasn't had her illusions,

19:06.880 --> 19:08.720
holding such paltry love

19:09.039 --> 19:10.720
dearer than all the world?

19:18.119 --> 19:19.519
Not one man is any good.

19:21.279 --> 19:22.319
You're an unmarried girl.

19:22.319 --> 19:23.359
What are you doing here?

19:23.519 --> 19:24.799
This isn't for your ears.

19:24.960 --> 19:25.720
Get out, now.

19:25.759 --> 19:26.759
Why can't I listen?

19:27.519 --> 19:28.240
These things

19:28.599 --> 19:30.440
should be made clear to a woman

19:30.519 --> 19:31.759
before she marries,

19:31.832 --> 19:33.440
so she doesn't reach her husband's home

19:33.799 --> 19:34.839
still clueless.

19:35.640 --> 19:37.039
With that wild temper of yours,

19:37.119 --> 19:38.359
no one will marry you.

19:38.519 --> 19:39.400
Listening is pointless.

19:39.640 --> 19:40.559
Go back, now.

19:40.648 --> 19:41.960
All the better if no one does.

19:43.119 --> 19:43.839
See?

19:49.960 --> 19:50.640
Xiuru.

19:51.559 --> 19:52.480
What do you

19:53.000 --> 19:54.200
really want?

19:57.559 --> 19:57.960
I...

20:00.839 --> 20:01.400
I...

20:02.519 --> 20:04.480
You have to tell us the truth

20:04.880 --> 20:06.720
so we can help you find a way.

20:08.279 --> 20:09.119
Xiuru,

20:09.480 --> 20:10.880
speak freely.

20:17.119 --> 20:19.720
I don't want him taking a concubine.

20:29.119 --> 20:30.519
Forgive me, I'm powerless.

20:30.880 --> 20:32.000
However capable I may be,

20:32.279 --> 20:34.519
I can't help you end the Yuan bloodline.

20:35.880 --> 20:36.359
You'll have

20:36.759 --> 20:37.960
to manage on your own.

20:39.559 --> 20:40.359
Shunhua.

20:41.039 --> 20:41.839
Shunhua.

20:41.960 --> 20:42.759
Shunhua.

20:44.920 --> 20:45.720
Shunhua.

20:46.350 --> 20:47.688
The Third Young Lady's troubles...

20:47.784 --> 20:49.096
are you really staying out of it?

20:50.920 --> 20:51.720
Shunhua.

20:52.720 --> 20:53.880
I knew it.

20:54.519 --> 20:56.119
What we women truly want

20:56.119 --> 20:57.720
counts for nothing.

20:58.279 --> 20:59.640
When family interests are at stake,

20:59.920 --> 21:01.599
who cares whether we women are happy

21:01.599 --> 21:02.519
or willing?

21:03.319 --> 21:05.039
I should never have said it.

21:05.440 --> 21:07.880
Now I've angered Mother as well.

21:10.079 --> 21:11.880
You're too heartless.

21:16.119 --> 21:17.359
Xiuru, don't cry.

21:19.799 --> 21:20.599
Lanxiang.

21:26.680 --> 21:27.480
Lanxiang.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.240
Please think of something

21:30.680 --> 21:31.880
to help Xiuru.

21:35.720 --> 21:37.119
Xiuru, don't cry.

21:49.440 --> 21:50.279
Stop crying.

21:53.240 --> 21:54.079
Stop crying.

21:57.440 --> 21:58.400
I said stop crying.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.160
Did you hear me?

22:05.039 --> 22:05.759
Xiuru,

22:06.839 --> 22:08.319
listen to what Lanxiang has to say.

22:10.119 --> 22:12.480
Yes, listen to Lanxiang.

22:22.119 --> 22:23.000
Xiuru.

22:23.720 --> 22:25.640
If you don't want Shaohui
to take a concubine,

22:26.319 --> 22:28.599
there's only one way now.

22:29.559 --> 22:30.640
What way?

22:32.440 --> 22:33.319
If Shaohui

22:33.319 --> 22:35.319
insists on doing as Old Madam Yuan says

22:35.640 --> 22:36.920
and taking Biwu as a concubine,

22:37.839 --> 22:38.960
then separate from him.

22:45.440 --> 22:46.279
I agree.

22:47.279 --> 22:47.960
No.

22:49.200 --> 22:49.920
No.

22:51.799 --> 22:53.440
Shaohui only wants a concubine,

22:53.680 --> 22:55.240
and it's for the sake of an heir.

22:56.319 --> 22:57.759
Why go as far as separating?

22:58.279 --> 23:00.039
Besides, there are three children.

23:01.039 --> 23:02.400
If one day they learned

23:02.632 --> 23:04.330
that their mother,
over so small a thing,

23:04.344 --> 23:05.200
had abandoned them,

23:05.680 --> 23:07.319
how could they bear it?

23:10.240 --> 23:11.680
Xiulai has a point.

23:12.720 --> 23:14.559
The Marquis's house is full of gossip.

23:15.319 --> 23:17.640
Children without a mother have it hard.

23:23.279 --> 23:24.519
What do you think, Xiuru?

23:35.279 --> 23:36.519
I'm too narrow-minded

23:37.839 --> 23:39.720
to be as generous as Mother wants.

23:41.160 --> 23:42.480
Rather than suffer day after day,

23:43.319 --> 23:44.839
it's better to end it quickly.

23:45.960 --> 23:47.119
I'd rather separate.

23:48.640 --> 23:49.319
All right.

23:50.640 --> 23:52.240
Since you've made up your mind,

23:53.119 --> 23:54.160
leave the rest

23:55.000 --> 23:56.640
to Jinqi and me.

23:58.880 --> 24:01.680
Jinqi and the Marquis are close friends.

24:02.359 --> 24:05.119
Would he truly quarrel with him for me?

24:06.160 --> 24:07.079
He would.

24:10.720 --> 24:12.920
My mother is gravely ill.
Her days are few.

24:14.119 --> 24:15.119
Her only wish

24:15.920 --> 24:17.079
is to hold a grandson.

24:18.240 --> 24:19.240
As her son,

24:19.720 --> 24:20.952
I have no choice but to obey.

24:22.480 --> 24:24.079
I hope you'll understand, Jinqi.

24:28.279 --> 24:29.079
I understand.

24:32.319 --> 24:33.400
But Xiuru

24:34.552 --> 24:36.296
would rather end it
with her pride intact

24:37.000 --> 24:38.350
than stay married by giving in.

24:40.260 --> 24:42.500
(Separation Agreement)

24:42.599 --> 24:43.359
Separation?

24:45.359 --> 24:46.559
This is absurd.

24:49.279 --> 24:49.960
I won't agree.

24:56.720 --> 24:58.240
Xiuru has made up her mind.

24:58.839 --> 25:00.079
Please grant her wish, Chengze.

25:01.079 --> 25:01.799
Old Madam.

25:06.519 --> 25:07.319
Mother.

25:07.519 --> 25:08.240
Aunt.

25:08.759 --> 25:10.759
So the Lin family wants a separation?

25:11.519 --> 25:12.000
Yes.

25:13.599 --> 25:14.400
Lin Jinqi.

25:15.039 --> 25:17.319
You're a marquis with no real power,

25:17.759 --> 25:19.680
and your heirs have yet to inherit.

25:20.200 --> 25:21.240
Where does the Lin family

25:21.559 --> 25:23.720
get the nerve to cross the Yuan family?

25:24.519 --> 25:25.599
We're not making trouble.

25:25.928 --> 25:27.400
I've invited the neighborhood headman,

25:27.410 --> 25:29.880
officials from the Ministry of War
and the Ministry of Justice

25:30.119 --> 25:31.640
to officiate the separation.

25:32.296 --> 25:33.790
If that's not making trouble, what is?

25:34.088 --> 25:36.280
(Huang Mainiang, wife)
Who invites the Ministry of War

25:36.350 --> 25:38.264
(of the late Marquis Yuan's cousin)
and Justice to officiate a separation?

25:40.000 --> 25:40.640
Third Aunt.

25:41.519 --> 25:43.319
My wife is a titled marchioness.

25:43.799 --> 25:44.640
By court law,

25:44.792 --> 25:46.456
any officer's titled wife who separates

25:46.472 --> 25:48.200
must report to the Ministry of War

25:48.264 --> 25:49.624
and the Ministry of Justice

25:50.039 --> 25:50.839
for approval.

25:51.160 --> 25:52.759
It was thanks to the Yuan family

25:53.119 --> 25:54.799
that she got that title at all.

25:55.079 --> 25:57.400
And now that Lin woman flaunts her title

25:57.440 --> 25:59.720
to make this the talk of the whole city,

26:00.000 --> 26:01.720
bringing shame on the Yuan family.

26:09.119 --> 26:09.799
Old Madam Yuan,

26:10.519 --> 26:11.519
I'll take my leave.

26:13.559 --> 26:14.039
Fengtai.

26:15.200 --> 26:15.680
Fengtai.

26:16.759 --> 26:17.240
Fengtai.

26:23.384 --> 26:24.750
Third Aunt, you know full well

26:25.160 --> 26:27.200
His Majesty used my wedding to Xiuru

26:27.200 --> 26:28.440
as cover to leave Jinling.

26:28.616 --> 26:30.200
Fengtai risked his life to protect him

26:30.200 --> 26:32.119
and get him safely back to the capital.

26:32.488 --> 26:33.880
How can you ignore your conscience

26:33.880 --> 26:35.240
and say such nonsense?

26:35.960 --> 26:38.680
That title, the Lins earned themselves.

26:42.119 --> 26:43.880
Marrying into the Lins was a mistake.

26:44.680 --> 26:46.680
A humble house with small-minded ways.

26:47.519 --> 26:48.599
Separate, then.

26:49.119 --> 26:50.519
The Yuans have no shortage of wives.

26:50.519 --> 26:51.519
They can't separate.

26:51.960 --> 26:53.119
Absolutely not.

26:55.079 --> 26:57.039
If they separate over a concubine,

26:57.039 --> 26:59.319
that jealous Lin woman will fare badly,

26:59.680 --> 27:02.160
and our family's name will suffer too.

27:03.240 --> 27:04.319
How could that be possible?

27:05.272 --> 27:07.224
Every official at court knows
that His Majesty

27:07.400 --> 27:10.440
only ascended the throne safely with
Lin family's help during the wedding.

27:10.952 --> 27:11.750
The Lin family also

27:11.760 --> 27:13.960
rendered meritorious service
in protecting His Majesty.

27:14.519 --> 27:15.920
After marrying into our family,

27:16.000 --> 27:17.920
she bore three daughters in succession.

27:18.088 --> 27:20.664
Even if she earned no merit,
she still endured years of hardship.

27:21.519 --> 27:24.559
Now their marriage
has fallen apart over a concubine.

27:25.640 --> 27:28.799
Our Yuan family will surely
face criticism and attacks.

27:30.039 --> 27:31.079
When that happens, my son

27:32.296 --> 27:33.960
will not only
have difficulty remarrying,

27:34.880 --> 27:37.440
but his official career
may also be affected.

27:46.200 --> 27:47.920
Your Lordship, Old Madam.

27:47.960 --> 27:49.590
A group of officials
has arrived outside.

27:49.799 --> 27:51.240
(Steward Fu, head steward)
They say Marquis Jing'an invited them

27:51.336 --> 27:52.584
(of the Yuan Residence, Biwu's father)
to preside over the separation

27:52.590 --> 27:53.830
of Your Lordship and the marchioness.

27:54.456 --> 27:56.480
Quite a few people
have gathered outside to watch.

27:56.559 --> 27:57.000
I...

27:57.440 --> 27:58.279
I had no choice.

27:58.440 --> 28:00.552
I could only invite them
into the residence first.

28:01.640 --> 28:02.880
I thought Lin

28:03.240 --> 28:05.000
was merely putting
on a show to frighten us.

28:05.192 --> 28:07.160
I never expected her
to truly seek a separation.

28:08.039 --> 28:10.359
Old Madam, what are we going to do?

28:16.140 --> 28:18.780
(Jiaxi Tower,
Marquis Yongchang's Residence)

28:33.960 --> 28:36.160
Since both families
have decided on a separation,

28:38.000 --> 28:38.880
this is

28:39.599 --> 28:41.200
the Lin family's Separation Agreement.

28:41.440 --> 28:43.519
Your Lordship, please take a look.

28:43.670 --> 28:45.540
(Separation Agreement)
If everything is in order,

28:45.559 --> 28:46.519
please sign it.

28:46.520 --> 28:47.350
(Separation Agreement)

28:55.208 --> 28:57.830
I will no longer have the good fortune
to serve you, Old Madam.

28:58.880 --> 29:01.599
I wish you good health

29:02.359 --> 29:03.519
and a long life.

29:15.599 --> 29:17.000
Third Young Lady

29:17.200 --> 29:19.599
truly loves Your Lordship
with all her heart.

29:21.039 --> 29:21.599
Tell me,

29:22.640 --> 29:24.480
how did things ever come to this?

29:24.759 --> 29:27.200
How did things come to this?

29:32.160 --> 29:33.359
Old Madam Yuan,

29:33.359 --> 29:35.039
my heart

29:36.119 --> 29:38.480
feels as if it's being cut with a knife.

29:39.720 --> 29:43.200
How did things really come to this?

29:46.024 --> 29:47.310
Must the Yuan and Lin families

29:48.759 --> 29:50.440
really come to this?

29:51.448 --> 29:52.440
We follow different ways.

29:53.480 --> 29:54.920
It's better to part in peace

29:55.720 --> 29:56.960
and each seek our own path.

29:57.559 --> 29:58.960
You make it sound so easy.

30:00.599 --> 30:02.960
Today, in front of everyone,
let me ask you this.

30:03.119 --> 30:04.200
If one day

30:05.480 --> 30:07.079
you're nearly forty,

30:07.720 --> 30:09.400
Lanxiang still has no son,

30:09.839 --> 30:11.920
and there's no heir
to the title of Marquis Jing'an,

30:12.599 --> 30:13.880
will you still be able

30:14.280 --> 30:15.590
to refuse to take a concubine?

30:28.319 --> 30:29.400
I stubbornly insisted

30:30.360 --> 30:32.110
on helping Xiulai
separate from her husband,

30:33.272 --> 30:35.720
and my wife helped me
bring her out of the inner residence.

30:38.319 --> 30:39.240
In the heavy snow,

30:40.830 --> 30:42.184
when I was on the verge of death,

30:43.440 --> 30:45.000
my wife never left my side.

30:46.079 --> 30:47.519
In the bitter cold,

30:48.359 --> 30:50.920
she stayed with me
through an entire day and night

30:53.599 --> 30:55.160
and even saved the whole Lin family.

30:56.480 --> 30:57.920
My wife has shown me kindness,

30:58.839 --> 30:59.680
loyalty,

31:00.519 --> 31:01.440
and love.

31:02.839 --> 31:05.400
If I betrayed her for the sake of a son

31:05.400 --> 31:06.480
I've never even met,

31:08.720 --> 31:10.119
what kind of man would I be?

31:12.000 --> 31:13.880
Even if I never have a son,

31:14.400 --> 31:17.240
then I must have offended Heaven
in my previous life

31:17.359 --> 31:19.440
and made my wife suffer alongside me.

31:23.559 --> 31:26.480
You risked your life
for that marquis title.

31:28.000 --> 31:28.920
You'd give it up?

31:34.039 --> 31:35.599
Marquis Yuan, you're mistaken.

31:39.720 --> 31:40.440
That title

31:41.799 --> 31:45.079
was won with both my wife's
life and mine on the line.

31:46.079 --> 31:47.400
Passing it down to our descendants

31:47.880 --> 31:50.880
isn't so they can live off
their ancestors' achievements,

31:51.119 --> 31:52.359
but so they can

31:52.359 --> 31:55.279
remember their ancestors' glory
and strive to better themselves.

31:56.960 --> 31:59.519
If my wife and I never have a son,

32:01.200 --> 32:02.559
then we'll return the title

32:04.039 --> 32:05.440
to the court.

32:13.880 --> 32:15.119
How did things

32:15.519 --> 32:18.160
really come to this?

32:19.119 --> 32:20.200
My dear sister.

32:23.608 --> 32:25.064
- First Madam.
- First Madam.

32:26.880 --> 32:27.680
Shunhua.

32:33.519 --> 32:34.440
My dear sister.

32:34.720 --> 32:36.240
This is all my fault.

32:36.392 --> 32:37.750
I said it in the heat of the moment

32:37.944 --> 32:39.510
and said I wouldn't interfere anymore.

32:39.880 --> 32:41.440
I never imagined these youngsters

32:41.759 --> 32:43.039
would be so bold

32:43.400 --> 32:44.960
as to turn a private family matter

32:44.960 --> 32:46.599
into the talk of the entire city.

32:46.680 --> 32:47.680
This is outrageous!

32:49.039 --> 32:51.160
You couldn't have come at a better time.

32:51.880 --> 32:53.559
Please talk some sense into Xiuru.

32:53.799 --> 32:54.839
What married couple

32:54.839 --> 32:56.799
separates over a concubine?

32:57.119 --> 32:58.039
Exactly.

32:58.599 --> 32:59.599
What married couple

32:59.599 --> 33:01.160
separates because of a concubine?

33:01.160 --> 33:01.720
Exactly.

33:02.039 --> 33:03.960
Once word gets out, everyone will think

33:04.039 --> 33:06.279
the Yuan family
did something disgraceful

33:06.680 --> 33:07.920
that drove a mother

33:08.184 --> 33:10.310
to seek a separation
despite having four daughters.

33:16.296 --> 33:17.830
What nonsense are you talking about?

33:23.799 --> 33:25.599
I am Marquis Yongchang's mother-in-law,

33:25.880 --> 33:26.880
and by imperial decree,

33:26.880 --> 33:28.856
I hold the court-conferred
title of marchioness.

33:29.920 --> 33:30.759
May I ask

33:31.119 --> 33:32.359
who exactly this woman is

33:32.519 --> 33:34.039
speaking so harshly and berating me?

33:36.839 --> 33:38.720
She's the wife
of the old Marquis's cousin.

33:42.400 --> 33:43.240
My dear sister,

33:43.839 --> 33:46.079
let's speak in private.

33:46.359 --> 33:47.799
Have them leave us.

33:51.000 --> 33:52.200
All of you, go outside for now.

34:09.440 --> 34:10.320
Go!

34:22.920 --> 34:23.840
My dear sister,

34:24.239 --> 34:26.000
I'm a straightforward person,

34:26.280 --> 34:28.079
so I'll speak plainly.

34:29.159 --> 34:32.199
If you want me to persuade
Xiuru to change her mind,

34:32.719 --> 34:34.519
you'll have to agree
to a few conditions.

34:36.199 --> 34:36.920
Go ahead.

34:37.760 --> 34:38.199
First,

34:38.840 --> 34:39.880
he may take a concubine,

34:40.519 --> 34:43.360
but she must be chosen
by the Lin family.

34:48.119 --> 34:49.000
My dear sister,

34:49.599 --> 34:51.039
what you want is a grandson.

34:51.079 --> 34:53.360
Why should it matter
which woman gives birth to him?

34:53.928 --> 34:56.480
If wife and concubine get along,
the household will be at peace,

34:56.559 --> 34:59.239
and my third son-in-law
can focus on his duties.

34:59.880 --> 35:01.119
If they don't get along

35:01.240 --> 35:02.840
and there's trouble like this every day,

35:02.872 --> 35:04.936
with Ministry of War officials
showing up one moment

35:04.952 --> 35:06.664
and Ministry of Justice officials
the next,

35:06.760 --> 35:07.639
my third son-in-law

35:08.920 --> 35:10.679
may not be able to take much more of it.

35:19.039 --> 35:19.400
Fine.

35:20.199 --> 35:21.199
I agree.

35:22.079 --> 35:24.079
The Lin family can choose the concubine.

35:28.559 --> 35:29.199
Second,

35:30.719 --> 35:32.079
the Marquis's family property

35:32.248 --> 35:35.070
may only be divided equally among
the children of his principal wife.

35:36.199 --> 35:36.559
You...

35:38.880 --> 35:40.039
You mean

35:40.920 --> 35:42.239
only Jiarong

35:42.639 --> 35:44.840
and Lin's daughters
can inherit the family property?

35:46.480 --> 35:49.360
The principal wife now
has four daughters.

35:49.800 --> 35:51.000
You're right, my dear sister.

35:51.032 --> 35:52.940
Then the four daughters
will divide it equally.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.639
After all, you want a grandson

35:55.000 --> 35:56.719
to inherit the marquis title.

35:57.320 --> 35:58.800
He'll already have the title.

35:58.810 --> 36:01.330
Why should he compete with his sisters
for the family property?

36:02.119 --> 36:03.599
What if I refuse?

36:06.639 --> 36:08.239
Even if I agree,

36:08.559 --> 36:10.519
my eldest son won't.

36:11.280 --> 36:12.599
He's a real firecracker.

36:12.728 --> 36:15.420
He was the one who urged Xiulai
to separate from her husband before.

36:15.519 --> 36:17.719
The case even went
to Shuntian Prefecture

36:17.840 --> 36:19.400
and drew His Majesty's attention.

36:19.920 --> 36:21.599
I simply can't control him.

36:22.320 --> 36:23.079
Aren't you afraid

36:23.080 --> 36:25.352
the reputation of the Lin family's
daughters will suffer

36:25.544 --> 36:27.720
and make it difficult
for them to marry in the future?

36:30.480 --> 36:32.559
My own daughter is already married.

36:33.119 --> 36:34.239
As for the others,

36:36.760 --> 36:38.400
I have enough troubles of my own.

36:38.480 --> 36:40.600
I can't worry about
what happens to everyone else.

36:41.719 --> 36:44.679
Your Lin family has gone too far.

36:54.000 --> 36:56.440
Old Madam Yuan,
you have a broad forehead

36:56.880 --> 36:58.079
and full earlobes.

36:58.312 --> 37:00.230
Those features promise
many blessed descendants.

37:00.328 --> 37:02.280
I'm sure you'll have
more than one grandson.

37:03.880 --> 37:05.239
Xiuru is still young.

37:05.840 --> 37:07.599
She may well have a son in the future.

37:08.920 --> 37:11.980
Since the principal wife's children
will divide the family property equally,

37:12.199 --> 37:14.440
a son would naturally
receive his share as well.

37:19.760 --> 37:21.280
Search your conscience and tell me,

37:22.239 --> 37:24.280
how can there be such a rule

37:24.719 --> 37:27.079
that daughters
inherit the family property?

37:27.512 --> 37:28.280
Old Madam Yuan,

37:28.328 --> 37:30.670
the idea that daughters
cannot inherit family property

37:30.679 --> 37:32.119
has never been an unalterable rule

37:32.199 --> 37:33.679
since ancient times.

37:34.239 --> 37:35.199
During the Han dynasty,

37:35.240 --> 37:37.368
daughters could not only
inherit family property,

37:37.599 --> 37:38.960
but even noble titles.

37:40.719 --> 37:42.000
How could that be possible?

37:42.360 --> 37:43.559
Why wouldn't it be?

37:44.719 --> 37:47.760
Even if you don't know there were
titled noblewomen in the Han dynasty,

37:47.920 --> 37:48.679
surely you know

37:48.904 --> 37:50.776
there was a female emperor
in the Tang dynasty.

37:51.320 --> 37:53.079
No matter how persuasively you put it,

37:53.599 --> 37:55.440
I cannot agree to let daughters

37:55.960 --> 37:57.190
inherit the family property.

37:57.639 --> 37:58.280
I agree.

38:18.760 --> 38:19.199
Mother.

38:20.159 --> 38:21.400
If the boy proves capable,

38:21.464 --> 38:23.112
he'll already have the marquis title.

38:23.400 --> 38:25.519
Building a fortune
of his own won't be difficult.

38:26.159 --> 38:27.239
If he proves incapable,

38:27.760 --> 38:28.800
forget the family property.

38:29.199 --> 38:31.480
He may not even
be able to keep the title.

38:31.976 --> 38:33.840
My daughters
are my own flesh and blood, too,

38:34.072 --> 38:35.550
and they carry the Yuan bloodline.

38:36.728 --> 38:38.710
I'm willing to leave
the family property to them

38:39.048 --> 38:40.800
so they can live
their lives in security.

38:58.440 --> 38:59.239
My dear sister,

39:00.880 --> 39:04.280
no one can have everything
go their way in life.

39:05.039 --> 39:08.079
Each side giving a little
is already the best outcome.

39:08.960 --> 39:09.960
You get your grandson,

39:10.440 --> 39:11.800
and their family stays together.

39:15.119 --> 39:15.920
Why

39:16.519 --> 39:18.320
force a loving couple

39:18.320 --> 39:19.960
to be torn apart

39:20.648 --> 39:21.630
and leave the children

39:22.199 --> 39:23.440
without their mother?

39:33.920 --> 39:34.920
I'm old now.

39:36.712 --> 39:37.592
As for this matter,

39:38.480 --> 39:39.800
I'll leave the decision to you.

40:05.340 --> 40:10.820
♪Time unfurls a long scroll♪

40:11.416 --> 40:13.460
This is the document dividing
the family property.

40:13.760 --> 40:14.840
Please take a look, Shaohui.

40:15.400 --> 40:16.480
If you have no objections,

40:16.648 --> 40:18.110
the neighborhood headman here

40:18.519 --> 40:19.760
can serve as your witness.

40:20.000 --> 40:21.000
Sign it.

40:21.000 --> 40:23.490
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

40:25.480 --> 40:26.039
All right.

40:26.039 --> 40:29.540
♪Each plant endures
its own trials before reaching shore♪

40:29.780 --> 40:33.020
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

40:33.020 --> 40:36.060
♪Only orchids dwell
in secluded places♪

40:36.420 --> 40:41.820
♪Watching the old and new
take turns in this world♪

40:41.820 --> 40:46.519
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

40:46.519 --> 40:47.920
I've put you through a lot today.

40:50.376 --> 40:52.424
What you said today
at the Yuan Residence

40:52.599 --> 40:54.039
in front of everyone...

40:55.768 --> 40:57.710
It may have come out
in the heat of my exchange

40:57.840 --> 40:58.880
with Chengze,

40:59.320 --> 41:01.000
but I meant every word.

41:03.519 --> 41:04.760
I swear that in this life,

41:05.304 --> 41:06.710
I will never take a concubine.

41:07.559 --> 41:08.280
My only wish

41:09.599 --> 41:10.840
is to hold your hand

41:11.480 --> 41:12.519
and grow old with you.

41:19.519 --> 41:20.320
Careful.

41:20.320 --> 41:22.020
(All afflictions arise from ignorance)

41:28.152 --> 41:29.070
- Mother.
- Mother.

41:29.960 --> 41:31.519
Shaohui has signed it?

41:32.679 --> 41:33.360
He's signed it.

41:38.599 --> 41:39.760
Have your wife

41:40.280 --> 41:41.440
sit down and join us.

41:42.719 --> 41:43.960
Thank you for the seat, Mother.

41:45.800 --> 41:46.280
Come.

41:57.639 --> 41:58.480
Tell me,

41:58.960 --> 42:00.719
when did you figure it out?

42:02.760 --> 42:05.400
I sensed something was strange
from the very beginning that day,

42:05.719 --> 42:07.239
but I couldn't figure out why.

42:08.239 --> 42:10.000
Then Mother swept out in anger,

42:10.199 --> 42:11.320
and I understood.

42:11.840 --> 42:13.199
Mother wanted us

42:13.480 --> 42:14.800
to be Xiuru's blade

42:15.320 --> 42:16.880
and force the Yuan family to yield.

42:20.079 --> 42:22.079
You really are a clever one.

42:23.239 --> 42:24.719
Lanxiang and I talked it over.

42:25.079 --> 42:26.800
When Xiuru was still unmarried,

42:26.872 --> 42:29.500
she already had the courage to seek
a better marriage for herself.

42:29.688 --> 42:31.880
She was never someone
who would lose herself in love.

42:32.719 --> 42:35.719
What she feared
wasn't Chengze taking a concubine,

42:36.159 --> 42:37.480
but the Yuan clansmen

42:37.624 --> 42:40.610
using a son born to a concubine to take
control of the Marquis's household.

42:41.360 --> 42:42.679
Then Xiuru and her daughters

42:42.800 --> 42:44.880
would be left at the mercy of others,

42:44.920 --> 42:47.890
forced to watch their every expression
and tread carefully just to survive.

42:48.360 --> 42:50.960
I knew Xiuru understood
what was at stake,

42:51.760 --> 42:53.679
so I showed her a way forward.

42:56.440 --> 42:57.079
You two

42:58.400 --> 43:00.760
shouldn't blame her
for going to such lengths.

43:05.100 --> 43:07.580
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.159 --> 43:09.360
Fainted! Unconscious now!

43:09.960 --> 43:10.599
Come here!

43:10.760 --> 43:11.840
Hurry over here!

43:11.880 --> 43:12.400
Come on!

43:12.840 --> 43:14.159
Quick, press the philtrum!

43:14.480 --> 43:14.920
Over here!

43:16.440 --> 43:17.320
Quick, come here!

43:17.639 --> 43:18.880
Hurry over here!

43:25.300 --> 43:27.770
- Mother and daughter are safe!
- Mother and daughter are safe!

43:27.784 --> 43:29.360
Wonderful!

43:29.360 --> 43:32.400
- Mother and daughter are safe!
- Mother and daughter are safe!

43:32.400 --> 43:33.144
The baby's born!

43:50.380 --> 43:54.500
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:57.340 --> 44:01.860
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:03.140 --> 44:07.060
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:07.740 --> 44:10.500
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:11.220 --> 44:13.540
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:13.540 --> 44:16.620
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:18.140 --> 44:22.380
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:25.300 --> 44:29.460
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:31.260 --> 44:34.820
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:34.820 --> 44:38.380
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:39.180 --> 44:44.860
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:45.220 --> 44:49.540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:49.900 --> 44:52.860
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:52.860 --> 44:56.620
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:56.620 --> 44:59.500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

44:59.500 --> 45:03.580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:03.580 --> 45:06.940
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:06.940 --> 45:10.700
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:10.700 --> 45:14.700
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:15.460 --> 45:19.620
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:19.620 --> 45:23.060
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:23.060 --> 45:26.700
